<section id="howitworks_lead">
	<div class="content">
		<h1>How to book direct</h1>
		<p>You can book talent directly by following the process below, for a smaller 10% booking fee. Or you can choose our professional agent service by reaching out to us at <a href="mailto:ian@idal.co">ian@idal.co</a> - we will find the best talent for you and sort out the entire booking.</p>
	</div>
</section>

<section>
	<div class="half">
		<div class="content">
			<h2>STEP 1: CREATING A CASTING REQUEST OR A BOOKING</h2>
			<p>Go to <em>Bookings</em> (the top right corner) and <strong><em>Create a Casting or a Booking</em></strong>. Fill in your project details such as <em>project name, type, usage, proposed rate, date</em> and <em>additional description</em>.</p>
			<p><i class="fa fa-star"></i> Fill in the details carefully before requesting the model(s), as they will make a decision based on your project information.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="half">
		<img src="/images/homepage/howto/client/7864f386-0f9a-43c9-b309-097b98991292-Mac-newproject.png">
	</div>
</section>

<section>
	<div class="half">
		<img src="/images/homepage/howto/client/208c749f-c9ff-4715-bb97-13c5155ff9e6-Macbook_Popuptalentboard.png">
	</div>
	<div class="half">
		<div class="content contentright">
			<h2>STEP 2: DISCOVERING TALENT</h2>
			<p>Upon project creation, iDAL will generate a board of <strong>available models for your date</strong>. Filter-search by size, categories, location, social media following and many other criteria to narrow down the selection. Once you found the model(s) you are interested in working with, click <strong><em>Shortlist</em></strong> on their profiles.</p>
			<p>Don't worry, <strong><em>Shortlisting</em></strong> does not send a casting or booking request yet.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section>
	<div class="half">
		<div class="content">
			<h2>STEP 3: REQUESTING MODELS</h2>
			<p><strong>View <em>Full Profile</em></strong> in a new window to see <em>Portfolio</em> and <em>Polaroids</em>. You can also <strong><em>Shortlist for Project</em></strong> from a model's profile.</p>
			<p>When ready, refresh the generated model board to update the count of selected models. Make direct requests to shortlisted models by clicking <strong><em>Request?</em></strong> on each model you’d like to work with.</p>
			<p><strong>All done for now – just lean back and wait for their replies!</strong></p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="half">
		<img src="/images/homepage/howto/client/f4edeb0a-9b9a-4f18-becf-800724f13ae0-Macbook_profile.png">
	</div>
</section>

<section>
	<div class="half">
		<img src="/images/homepage/howto/client/e4319b33-a651-45a5-88c8-ae9f0ff66f65-Macbook_requesting.png">
	</div>
	<div class="half">
		<div class="content contentright">
			<h2>OPTIONAL STEP: NEGOTIATE THE OFFERED RATE</h2>
			<p>Models can <strong>negotiate</strong> your offered rate. Accept, decline, or make a counter offer until the agreed rate has been reached.To respond to a model's new, suggested rate, go to your projects and click <strong><em>Negotiate?</em></strong> on the negotiating model's profile under <em>Models</em> tab.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section>
	<div class="half">
		<div class="content">
			<h2>STEP 4: CONFIRMING MODELS</h2>
			<p>After the requested model(s) have accepted your offer, click <em>Confirm</em> on their model profiles. You will need to agree to our booking contract to confirm.</p>
			<p><i class="fas fa-star"></i> Make sure you specify correct usage rights for your booking.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="half">
		<img src="/images/homepage/howto/client/5dc680c7-9e8c-426b-92ee-15fe47c1bb4b-Macbook_Confirm.png">
	</div>
</section>

<section>
	<div class="half">
		<img src="/images/homepage/howto/client/cf68b1d6-df3a-42fd-aeb7-06968681a10c-Macbook_invoice.png">
	</div>
	<div class="half">
		<div class="content contentright">
			<h2>STEP 5: MAKING PAYMENTS</h2>
			<p>Settle the total fee for the project after confirming the final rate with the model(s).Access your invoices under <strong><em>Payments</em></strong> when logged in.Your total amount includes iDAL’s 10% commission and 20% VAT unless stated otherwise. Kindly pay online using a credit or debit card.</p>
			<p>Models will receive your payment instantly through our secure and fast payment system.</p>
			<p><i class="fa fa-star"></i> Some clients are eligible for <strong>invoicing</strong> and payment via bank transfer. If this suits your brand better, request this function from <a href="support@idal.co">support@idal.co</a>. For further information, read our <a href="/terms">T&amp;Cs</a>.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>




<section>
	<div class="content">
		<h1>Managing bookings</h1>
	</div>
</section>

<section>
	<div class="half">
		<div class="content">
			<h2>Making Last-Minute Bookings</h2>
			<p>View models’ availability for the upcoming six days by hovering over their image on the model board, or applying the availability filters.</p>
			<div style="text-align: left; margin-left: 4em;">
				<p><i class="fa fa-check" style="color: green;"></i> <em>Available</em><br />
				<i class="fa fa-minus" style="color: grey;"></i> <em>No specific status - offers will be considered</em><br />
				<i class="fa fa-times" style="color: red;"></i> <em>Unavailable</em></p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="half">
		<img src="/images/homepage/howto/client/2fa21659-c133-40af-8676-083cd43b0d66-talent_board_all_models.png">
	</div>
</section>

<section>
	<div class="half">
		<img src="/images/homepage/howto/client/MacVII-Share_with_team.png">
	</div>
	<div class="half">
		<div class="content contentright">
			<h2>Collaborating on your booking</h2>
			<p>You can efficiently manage your bookings and payments together with your team by taking advantage of our special company accounts.</p>
			<p>Apply for a company account by emailing <a href="mailto:support@idal.co">support@idal.co</a>.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section>
	<div class="half">
		<div class="content">
			<h2>Direct Message Models</h2>
			<p>Use our built-in chat to direct message <em>requested</em> models. This function is available under the <em>Models</em> tab in your project details.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="half">
		<img src="/images/homepage/howto/client/ee760421-36c2-41da-80c8-8bddc5c6feab-message_model.png">
	</div>
</section>

<section>
	<div class="half">
		<img src="/images/homepage/howto/client/f4edeb0a-9b9a-4f18-becf-800724f13ae0-Macbook_profile.png">
	</div>
	<div class="half">
		<div class="content contentright">
			<h2>Generating PDF Portfolios</h2>
			<p>Download models' full profiles in a PDF format to share with your team by simply clicking <strong><em>Download Portfolio</em></strong> on a model's profile.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section>
	<div class="half">
		<div class="content contentright">
			<h2>Uploading a Callsheet and Moodboard</h2>
			<p>To make sure models are fully prepared for your shoot, feel free to share further information by uploading a call sheet or moodboard in PDF.</p>
			<p>Go to <strong><em>Bookings</em></strong> and click <strong><em>Add Callsheet/Moodboard</em></strong> on your upcoming project. You can only add one PDF file, and the confirmed models will be immediately notified.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="half">
		<img src="/images/homepage/howto/client/MacVII-upload_callsheet.png">
	</div>
</section>

<section>
	<div class="content">
		<a class="button burgundy" href="/search" style="margin-bottom: 4em;">Find talent</a>
	</div>
</section>










